# PSR-9a — Closure scorecard scaffold

## Intent

Make the SoT PSR-9 closure table **machine-readable** and **re-measurable**
without claiming program closure. Collector writes a JSON report (gitignored
under `reports/psr/`); smoke asserts scaffold integrity + collector runs.

## Commands

```bash
node scripts/ops/psr-9-closure-scorecard-collect.mjs
node scripts/ops/psr-9a-closure-scorecard-smoke.mjs
```

## Honesty

- Metrics are **tips** at collection time — not a release SHA evidence pack.
- Harbor durable code ≠ Harbor `certified` (still `stub`).
- Secret-scan / SBOM tooling baselines ≠ PSR-7 gate closed.
- Dirty worktree / Denali export counts may need deeper collectors in later slices.

## Next

`PSR-9b-scorecard-collectors-expand` (dirty worktree, Denali exports, absolute
paths) or prioritized live YES / `PSR-7d1` / `PSR-8b`.
